{"id":85,"name":"البروج","transliteration":"Al-Buruj","translation_fr":"Les constellations","translation_en":"The Mansions of the Stars","type":"meccan","total_verses":22,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ ذَاتِ ٱلۡبُرُوجِ","translation_fr":"Par le ciel aux constellations","translation_en":"By the sky containing great stars","transliteration":"Waalssamai thati alburooji"},{"id":2,"text":"وَٱلۡيَوۡمِ ٱلۡمَوۡعُودِ","translation_fr":"et par le jour promis","translation_en":"And [by] the promised Day","transliteration":"Waalyawmi almawAAoodi"},{"id":3,"text":"وَشَاهِدٖ وَمَشۡهُودٖ","translation_fr":"et par le témoin et ce dont on témoigne","translation_en":"And [by] the witness and what is witnessed","transliteration":"Washahidin wamashhoodin"},{"id":4,"text":"قُتِلَ أَصۡحَٰبُ ٱلۡأُخۡدُودِ","translation_fr":"Périssent les gens de l'Uhdûd","translation_en":"Cursed were the companions of the trench","transliteration":"Qutila ashabu alukhdoodi"},{"id":5,"text":"ٱلنَّارِ ذَاتِ ٱلۡوَقُودِ","translation_fr":"par le feu plein de combustible","translation_en":"[Containing] the fire full of fuel","transliteration":"Alnnari thati alwaqoodi"},{"id":6,"text":"إِذۡ هُمۡ عَلَيۡهَا قُعُودٞ","translation_fr":"cependant qu'ils étaient assis tout autour","translation_en":"When they were sitting near it","transliteration":"Ith hum AAalayha quAAoodun"},{"id":7,"text":"وَهُمۡ عَلَىٰ مَا يَفۡعَلُونَ بِٱلۡمُؤۡمِنِينَ شُهُودٞ","translation_fr":"ils étaient ainsi témoins de ce qu'ils faisaient des croyants","translation_en":"And they, to what they were doing against the believers, were witnesses","transliteration":"Wahum AAala ma yafAAaloona bialmumineena shuhoodun"},{"id":8,"text":"وَمَا نَقَمُواْ مِنۡهُمۡ إِلَّآ أَن يُؤۡمِنُواْ بِٱللَّهِ ٱلۡعَزِيزِ ٱلۡحَمِيدِ","translation_fr":"à qui ils ne leur reprochaient que d'avoir cru en Allah, le Puissant, le Digne de louange","translation_en":"And they resented them not except because they believed in Allah, the Exalted in Might, the Praiseworthy","transliteration":"Wama naqamoo minhum illa an yuminoo biAllahi alAAazeezi alhameedi"},{"id":9,"text":"ٱلَّذِي لَهُۥ مُلۡكُ ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ وَٱلۡأَرۡضِۚ وَٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَيۡءٖ شَهِيدٌ","translation_fr":"Auquel appartient la royauté des cieux et de la terre. Allah est témoin de toute chose","translation_en":"To whom belongs the dominion of the heavens and the earth. And Allah, over all things, is Witness","transliteration":"Allathee lahu mulku alssamawati waalardi waAllahu AAala kulli shayin shaheedun"},{"id":10,"text":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ فَتَنُواْ ٱلۡمُؤۡمِنِينَ وَٱلۡمُؤۡمِنَٰتِ ثُمَّ لَمۡ يَتُوبُواْ فَلَهُمۡ عَذَابُ جَهَنَّمَ وَلَهُمۡ عَذَابُ ٱلۡحَرِيقِ","translation_fr":"Ceux qui font subir des épreuves aux croyants et aux croyantes, puis ne se repentent pas, auront le châtiment de l'Enfer et le supplice du feu","translation_en":"Indeed, those who have tortured the believing men and believing women and then have not repented will have the punishment of Hell, and they will have the punishment of the Burning Fire","transliteration":"Inna allatheena fatanoo almumineena waalmuminati thumma lam yatooboo falahum AAathabu jahannama walahum AAathabu alhareeqi"},{"id":11,"text":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُواْ وَعَمِلُواْ ٱلصَّـٰلِحَٰتِ لَهُمۡ جَنَّـٰتٞ تَجۡرِي مِن تَحۡتِهَا ٱلۡأَنۡهَٰرُۚ ذَٰلِكَ ٱلۡفَوۡزُ ٱلۡكَبِيرُ","translation_fr":"Ceux qui croient et accomplissent les bonnes œuvres auront des Jardins sous lesquels coulent les ruisseaux. Cela est le grand succès","translation_en":"Indeed, those who have believed and done righteous deeds will have gardens beneath which rivers flow. That is the great attainment","transliteration":"Inna allatheena amanoo waAAamiloo alssalihati lahum jannatun tajree min tahtiha alanharu thalika alfawzu alkabeeru"},{"id":12,"text":"إِنَّ بَطۡشَ رَبِّكَ لَشَدِيدٌ","translation_fr":"La riposte de ton Seigneur est redoutable","translation_en":"Indeed, the vengeance of your Lord is severe","transliteration":"Inna batsha rabbika lashadeedun"},{"id":13,"text":"إِنَّهُۥ هُوَ يُبۡدِئُ وَيُعِيدُ","translation_fr":"C'est Lui, certes, qui commence (la création) et la refait","translation_en":"Indeed, it is He who originates [creation] and repeats","transliteration":"Innahu huwa yubdio wayuAAeedu"},{"id":14,"text":"وَهُوَ ٱلۡغَفُورُ ٱلۡوَدُودُ","translation_fr":"Et c'est Lui le Pardonneur, le Tout-Affectueux","translation_en":"And He is the Forgiving, the Affectionate","transliteration":"Wahuwa alghafooru alwadoodu"},{"id":15,"text":"ذُو ٱلۡعَرۡشِ ٱلۡمَجِيدُ","translation_fr":"Le Maître du Trône, le Tout-Glorieux","translation_en":"Honorable Owner of the Throne","transliteration":"Thoo alAAarshi almajeedi"},{"id":16,"text":"فَعَّالٞ لِّمَا يُرِيدُ","translation_fr":"Il réalise parfaitement tout ce qu'Il veut","translation_en":"Effecter of what He intends","transliteration":"FaAAAAalun lima yureedu"},{"id":17,"text":"هَلۡ أَتَىٰكَ حَدِيثُ ٱلۡجُنُودِ","translation_fr":"T'est-il parvenu le récit des armées","translation_en":"Has there reached you the story of the soldiers","transliteration":"Hal ataka hadeethu aljunoodi"},{"id":18,"text":"فِرۡعَوۡنَ وَثَمُودَ","translation_fr":"de Pharaon, et de Thamûd","translation_en":"[Those of] Pharaoh and Thamud","transliteration":"FirAAawna wathamooda"},{"id":19,"text":"بَلِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْ فِي تَكۡذِيبٖ","translation_fr":"Mais ceux qui ne croient pas persistent à démentir","translation_en":"But they who disbelieve are in [persistent] denial","transliteration":"Bali allatheena kafaroo fee taktheebin"},{"id":20,"text":"وَٱللَّهُ مِن وَرَآئِهِم مُّحِيطُۢ","translation_fr":"alors qu'Allah, derrière eux, les cerne de toutes parts","translation_en":"While Allah encompasses them from behind","transliteration":"WaAllahu min waraihim muheetun"},{"id":21,"text":"بَلۡ هُوَ قُرۡءَانٞ مَّجِيدٞ","translation_fr":"Mais c'est plutôt un Coran glorifié","translation_en":"But this is an honored Qur'an","transliteration":"Bal huwa quranun majeedun"},{"id":22,"text":"فِي لَوۡحٖ مَّحۡفُوظِۭ","translation_fr":"préservé sur une Tablette (auprès d'Allah)","translation_en":"[Inscribed] in a Preserved Slate","transliteration":"Fee lawhin mahfoothin"}]}